            "choice": "Dedicated `app/api/assistant/stream/route.ts` Route Handler",
            "rationale": "SSE requires a long-lived response, incremental writes, disconnect detection, and in-band post-commit errors; Server Actions and ordinary request retries do not provide these lifecycle guarantees."
